00:58:22.732 --> 00:58:24.434
I do in my life

00:58:24.434 --> 00:58:25.034
First of all

00:58:25.034 --> 00:58:25.501
I personally

00:58:25.501 --> 00:58:27.136
am indeed pretty boring in my personal life

00:58:27.136 --> 00:58:28.972
So I don't have many interesting life dilemmas

00:58:28.972 --> 00:58:30.139
to ask Doubao

00:58:30.173 --> 00:58:31.241
The questions I have more often in life

00:58:31.241 --> 00:58:32.542
