00:58:32.575 --> 00:58:34.510
Asking a smart model like Gemini is the best

00:58:34.510 --> 00:58:37.046
Hahahaha

00:58:37.046 --> 00:58:39.716
Right
I don't have this urge to open Doubao at midnight

00:58:39.716 --> 00:58:41.017
