00:58:44.153 --> 00:58:46.189
Hmm
You might run into some problem

00:58:46.356 --> 00:58:50.159
You might need someone to tell you right away

00:58:50.159 --> 00:58:52.462
But you don't have such a person

00:58:52.462 --> 00:58:53.229
Hmm, those

00:58:53.229 --> 00:58:54.964
