00:59:07.143 --> 00:59:08.778
I think it's possible

00:59:08.778 --> 00:59:09.913
The fact is

00:59:10.213 --> 00:59:11.848
If you ask about these daily topics

00:59:11.848 --> 00:59:13.049
actually

00:59:13.049 --> 00:59:13.917
you'll find that Gemini

00:59:13.917 --> 00:59:15.552
