00:59:15.552 --> 00:59:17.153
does better and better

00:59:17.153 --> 00:59:17.620
Hmm

00:59:17.620 --> 00:59:19.322
Actually, many of my friends

00:59:19.322 --> 00:59:20.356
including myself in the past

00:59:20.356 --> 00:59:22.258
When I was at Anthropic before

00:59:22.258 --> 00:59:23.860
