01:01:23.546 --> 01:01:26.582
Now, I think

01:01:26.849 --> 01:01:29.052
Apple definitely cares about AI strategy

01:01:29.819 --> 01:01:33.556
Because Siri, the phone assistant

01:01:33.723 --> 01:01:36.325
