01:02:00.817 --> 01:02:01.617
Ah

01:02:02.652 --> 01:02:03.486
Saving face

01:02:03.619 --> 01:02:05.655
Ah, right, hahaha (I don't care)

01:02:05.822 --> 01:02:07.123
Then let's talk about Doubao's model

01:02:07.123 --> 01:02:10.526
