01:02:17.200 --> 01:02:22.305
I mean, I think the voice quality might be

01:02:24.640 --> 01:02:26.809
To put it politely, probably one of the best in the world

01:02:26.843 --> 01:02:27.310
To put it bluntly

01:02:27.310 --> 01:02:28.511
I think it's simply the best in the world

01:02:28.511 --> 01:02:30.146
Mm. Is that hard?

01:02:30.480 --> 01:02:31.280
Mm

01:02:32.115 --> 01:02:33.983
