It has to be a model thing

01:02:42.725 --> 01:02:44.460
It might also include some product aspects

01:02:44.460 --> 01:02:46.529
But it's definitely a model thing

01:02:46.662 --> 01:02:48.498
Right. And then

01:02:48.498 --> 01:02:48.898
I think that's one aspect

01:02:48.898 --> 01:02:50.900
And on the other hand

01:02:50.900 --> 01:02:52.301
On the other hand, I don't have that much personal experience

01:02:52.301 --> 01:02:53.870
Because I haven't actually used it that much

01:02:54.070 --> 01:02:55.638
So it's probably more from

01:02:55.638 --> 01:02:56.706
Feedback from friends and family

01:02:56.706 --> 01:03:00.176
That is
Hey, this Doubao model is just fun to talk

01:03:00.176 --> 01:03:01.277
It's just fun to chat with

01:03:01.277 --> 01:03:02.411
Haha, right

01:03:02.411 --> 01:03:03.446
But I think that

01:03:03.446 --> 01:03:05.281
