01:03:16.125 --> 01:03:18.161
But I'm talking about trivial things in your daily life

01:03:18.161 --> 01:03:19.629
I don't want to see its chain of thought

01:03:20.563 --> 01:03:21.998
Right. I don't think this is technically difficult

01:03:21.998 --> 01:03:22.932
It's just that maybe

01:03:22.932 --> 01:03:25.001
People haven't spent more time on it yet

01:03:25.001 --> 01:03:25.802
On this

01:03:25.868 --> 01:03:26.769
And the fact is

01:03:26.769 --> 01:03:31.707
If you try Gemini 2.5 Pro and Gemini 2.5 Flash

01:03:31.707 --> 01:03:32.375
