01:03:32.375 --> 01:03:32.875
Gemini 2.5 Flash

01:03:32.875 --> 01:03:35.678
When completing the same problem

01:03:35.678 --> 01:03:37.280
It's already much faster than before

01:03:37.280 --> 01:03:38.815
And much less fluff

01:03:39.015 --> 01:03:42.418
So I don't think this is a

01:03:42.518 --> 01:03:44.654
Mm-hmm, in my view it's not a technical difficulty

