01:51:31.818 --> 01:51:33.053
Some don't do it well

01:51:33.420 --> 01:51:34.821
So you say doing AI research now

01:51:34.821 --> 01:51:37.223
Is like doing thermodynamics research in the 17th century

01:51:37.223 --> 01:51:38.425
What it's actually expressing is

01:51:38.425 --> 01:51:42.429
Although everyone can't very clearly

01:51:42.429 --> 01:51:44.964
Scientifically explain and understand this thing

01:51:44.964 --> 01:51:47.300
But it won't stop it from developing

01:51:47.434 --> 01:51:50.603
Right it's more like

01:51:50.837 --> 01:51:51.304
Why

01:51:51.304 --> 01:51:52.172
Comparing to thermodynamics of that era

01:51:52.172 --> 01:51:53.239
In that era

01:51:53.239 --> 01:51:57.577
Everyone actually didn't understand the microscopic theory of heat

01:51:57.577 --> 01:51:59.145
Everyone didn't know what heat was

01:51:59.179 --> 01:52:01.147
Just like now we can't understand

01:52:01.214 --> 01:52:01.915
Right just like now

01:52:01.915 --> 01:52:02.749
Everyone can't understand

01:52:02.749 --> 01:52:04.717
Which matrix element in this language model

01:52:04.717 --> 01:52:07.053
