01:52:07.554 --> 01:52:08.721
Actually everyone doesn't understand

01:52:08.822 --> 01:52:12.258
But it doesn't prevent you from having some good empirical laws

01:52:12.892 --> 01:52:14.260
Like various laws of thermodynamics

01:52:14.260 --> 01:52:16.696
And various Scaling Laws now

01:52:16.696 --> 01:52:18.531
So

01:52:18.932 --> 01:52:20.800
From this perspective it is

01:52:21.067 --> 01:52:22.135
From this

01:52:22.135 --> 01:52:23.403
From the perspective of this direction

01:52:23.403 --> 01:52:24.604
Yes

01:52:24.604 --> 01:52:25.405
At this level

01:52:25.405 --> 01:52:26.306
It's something like

01:52:26.473 --> 01:52:28.508
