02:01:38.291 --> 02:01:39.091
Why

02:01:39.091 --> 02:01:40.026
Because

02:01:40.026 --> 02:01:43.296
Implementing top-down actually has one very difficult point

02:01:43.696 --> 02:01:47.333
That the person making technical decisions

02:01:47.633 --> 02:01:49.935
