02:01:49.935 --> 02:01:51.003
Mm-hmm

02:01:51.270 --> 02:01:54.573
First of all you have to be technically convincing

02:01:54.774 --> 02:01:57.143
Then the researchers below will

02:01:57.543 --> 02:01:58.844
You can then

02:01:58.844 --> 02:02:00.746
Convince the researchers below to do this thing

02:02:01.514 --> 02:02:03.749
On the other hand, you have to be the decision-maker at the company

02:02:03.749 --> 02:02:05.785
You have to be able to take responsibility for the company

02:02:06.352 --> 02:02:07.687
Anthropic has that going for it

02:02:07.687 --> 02:02:11.557
