02:02:49.395 --> 02:02:51.330
But is this hard for other model companies?

02:02:51.497 --> 02:02:53.365
Very hard. For example, OpenAI couldn't do it

02:02:54.200 --> 02:02:54.800
&lt;b&gt;When Ilya was

02:02:54.800 --> 02:02:55.401
there, wasn't it possible?

02:02:55.401 --> 02:02:56.936
