02:42:44.321 --> 02:42:45.655
Humans are actually like this

02:42:45.922 --> 02:42:47.591
Human context is actually very very short

02:42:47.691 --> 02:42:48.692
If you ask me now what I ate last night

02:42:48.692 --> 02:42:49.693
I can't remember at all

02:42:50.594 --> 02:42:51.495
Ah you might still remember

02:42:51.495 --> 02:42:53.130
Hahaha I can't remember at all

02:42:53.263 --> 02:42:54.064
Because why

02:42:54.064 --> 02:42:56.066
Because it's not critical to my current scenario

02:42:56.266 --> 02:42:57.801
Right
Like even if I knew what I ate last night

02:42:57.801 --> 02:42:58.602
So what

02:42:58.735 --> 02:42:59.870
So I choose to forget it

02:43:00.170 --> 02:43:02.139
So human context is essentially very short

02:43:02.305 --> 02:43:03.773
But they can selectively forget

02:43:04.341 --> 02:43:07.077
And selectively retrieve

02:43:07.077 --> 02:43:09.212
To bring back these important

02:43:09.212 --> 02:43:11.181
Information relevant to the current scenario

02:43:12.282 --> 02:43:13.216
So

02:43:13.416 --> 02:43:15.719
