It's because
Continue learning changes some of the model's weights

03:10:56.444 --> 03:10:58.146
And when you do this kind of

03:10:58.146 --> 03:10:59.114
For example, like open

03:10:59.114 --> 03:10:59.948
Open source

03:10:59.948 --> 03:11:01.049
Everyone does a lot of this kind of

03:11:01.049 --> 03:11:02.517
