03:12:31.606 --> 03:12:33.441
State and action

03:12:33.508 --> 03:12:35.710
And it's end-to-end training this kind of capability

03:12:35.944 --> 03:12:39.481
Right so this might be one solution

03:12:39.481 --> 03:12:40.348
And I

03:12:40.348 --> 03:12:41.149
First I don't know

03:12:41.149 --> 03:12:42.751
