03:34:12.906 --> 03:34:13.774
Right, and then

03:34:14.041 --> 03:34:15.742
But I think AI

03:34:15.742 --> 03:34:18.111
is a very vast field

03:34:18.111 --> 03:34:20.214
Language models are just a tiny, tiny part of it

03:34:20.214 --> 03:34:21.348
A very small part

03:34:21.448 --> 03:34:22.583
There are many other things

03:34:22.583 --> 03:34:24.017
Like the multimodal generation we just mentioned

03:34:24.251 --> 03:34:26.220
There may still be many opportunities there

03:34:26.220 --> 03:34:27.921
Robotics probably has even more opportunities

03:34:28.388 --> 03:34:30.724
