03:34:37.097 --> 03:34:38.432
quantum control and things like that

03:34:38.632 --> 03:34:40.334
Then it might be more blue ocean

03:34:40.734 --> 03:34:42.102
Those are all blue sky things

03:34:42.135 --> 03:34:43.904
Right so

03:34:43.904 --> 03:34:45.839
I think for

03:34:47.441 --> 03:34:48.942
People young enough

03:34:48.942 --> 03:34:50.544
Maybe doing the hottest thing right now

03:34:50.544 --> 03:34:52.246
